#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:328
msgid ""
"Go to :guilabel:`SSL/TLS` and set the encryption mode to :guilabel:`Full`."
msgstr ""
"Отидете на :guilabel:`SSL/TLS` и задайте режима на криптиране на "
":guilabel:`Full`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:0
